    "name": "Warli spelling correction / normalization table",
    "description": "wrong -> correct Warli spelling pairs. In the real project these come from the annotated audio recording (voice_recording.*) where incorrect Warli spellings are marked alongside the correct one; the bulk of this table is the Hindi/Marathi-influenced normalization layer built on top of those annotations. It is applied AFTER dictionary lookup and grammar, to the Warli output token. It is a correction/validation dataset, NOT ASR training data.",
